Main concept

The most important code is:

Center(
  child: Text('Hello Flutter!'),
)

The Center widget takes one child and positions that child at the center of its available space.

Output: A blue AppBar at the top with Center Widget, and Hello Flutter! displayed in bold blue text at the center of the screen.


